{"id":"115b03357940aa38","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-provably-recursive-function.md","title":"Provably Recursive Function","display":"df-provably-recursive-function — Provably Recursive Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-provably-recursive-function","aliases":["18-df-provably-recursive-function","18-df-062"],"display":"df-provably-recursive-function — Provably Recursive Function","depends_on":["[[18-df-arithmetic-realization]]","[[18-df-computation-coding]]","[[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]"],"source_work":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)","source_section":"Theorem 10.1.1; Definition 10.1.4","source_printed_pages":"208–209","source_pdf_pages":"218–219","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_proof_review":"未逐项复核原书证明","local_revision":"2026-10-14","local_review_scope":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification","prior_revision_verification_status":"source-statement-checked","prior_eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"patch_revision":"2026-10-14","patch_verification_status":"local-formalization-review; not-machine-checked","patch_review_scope":"固定 Total_e 的实际语法树及伪句输出域；保持真实总性条件和固定程序指标的可证性定义。","patch_source_review":"no new source-page or source-proof verification"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-provably-recursive-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-provably-recursive-function</span><span>18-df-062</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provably-recursive-function — Provably Recursive Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6d3242aa1837d0b9\" href=\"?note=6d3242aa1837d0b9\" title=\"18-df-arithmetic-realization\">18-df-arithmetic-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c1845536b726c45\" href=\"?note=6c1845536b726c45\" title=\"18-df-computation-coding\">18-df-computation-coding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7ddb1b71680edcd2\" href=\"?note=7ddb1b71680edcd2\" title=\"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language\">18-df-arithmetic-tait-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_work","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Theorem 10.1.1; Definition 10.1.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"208–209"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"218–219"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_review","html":"未逐项复核原书证明"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"local_review_scope","html":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification"},{"key":"prior_revision_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"prior_eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"patch_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"patch_verification_status","html":"local-formalization-review; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"patch_review_scope","html":"固定 Total_e 的实际语法树及伪句输出域；保持真实总性条件和固定程序指标的可证性定义。"},{"key":"patch_source_review","html":"no new source-page or source-proof verification"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T,\\iota\">\\(S,T,\\iota\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6d3242aa1837d0b9\" href=\"?note=6d3242aa1837d0b9\" title=\"18-df-arithmetic-realization\">18-df-arithmetic-realization</a>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为一阶签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 是从源算术公式到目标公式的固定单值图，并包含下式全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Total}_e\">\\(\\mathrm{Total}_e\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak T=\\langle S,T,\\iota\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak T=\\langle S,T,\\iota\\rangle\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf T^1,U,a_T,\\Phi_e\">\\(\\mathsf T^1,U,a_T,\\Phi_e\\)</span> 全部采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6c1845536b726c45\" href=\"?note=6c1845536b726c45\" title=\"18-df-computation-coding\">18-df-computation-coding</a> 的本地计算编码，不能另取未提供的外部接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(f:\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span> 是真实总函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\omega\">\\(e\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline e\">\\(\\overline e\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7ddb1b71680edcd2\" href=\"?note=7ddb1b71680edcd2\" title=\"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language\">18-df-arithmetic-tait-language</a> 的数码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0,x_1\">\\(x_0,x_1\\)</span> 是该语言固定枚举中的前两个数变量；终止公式的绑定位置仅使用这两个变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Total}_e\">\\(\\mathrm{Total}_e\\)</span> 是 Tait 公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_T\">\\(a_T\\)</span> 作为三元本原递归函数符号使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Total}_e\\coloneqq\\forall x_0\\;\\exists x_1\\;(a_T(\\overline e,x_0,x_1)=\\overline1)\\qquad(e\\in\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Total}_e\\coloneqq\\forall x_0\\;\\exists x_1\\;(a_T(\\overline e,x_0,x_1)=\\overline1)\\qquad(e\\in\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall e\\in\\omega\\quad\\mathrm{Total}_e\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall e\\in\\omega\\quad\\mathrm{Total}_e\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProvablyRecursive}_{\\mathfrak T}(f)\\longleftrightarrow\n\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;[&amp;\\operatorname{ArPrv}_{S,T,\\iota}(\\mathrm{Total}_e)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\omega\\;\\exists s\\in\\omega\\;\\mathsf T^1(e,x,s)\\\\\n&amp;\\land f=\\Phi_e].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProvablyRecursive}_{\\mathfrak T}(f)\\longleftrightarrow\n\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;[&amp;\\operatorname{ArPrv}_{S,T,\\iota}(\\mathrm{Total}_e)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\omega\\;\\exists s\\in\\omega\\;\\mathsf T^1(e,x,s)\\\\\n&amp;\\land f=\\Phi_e].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原定义“真实一元总函数”的范围及外部总性条件，不从不可靠理论的可证性推出实际终止。输出图由本地有效有限记录定义，单值性见计算编码节点；外部总性使它确为总函数。对象理论只证明固定程序指标的终止公式，不能用任意可定义函数的唯一存在替代计算见证。</p>\n<p>修复了原定义依赖未提供的 T¹、U 文本，以及“标准原始递归表示”没有语法实现的问题。新编码是按现有上下文重建的本地编码，不宣称恢复缺失源文件的逐字文本。</p>\n<p>固定绑定变量只消除具体语法实现的选择依赖；不增加理论可靠性假设，也不把理论内的终止可证性当成外部总性的替代。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-arithmetic-realization","status":"resolved","id":"6d3242aa1837d0b9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-arithmetic-realization]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-computation-coding","status":"resolved","id":"6c1845536b726c45","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-computation-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language","status":"resolved","id":"7ddb1b71680edcd2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-arithmetic-realization","status":"resolved","id":"6d3242aa1837d0b9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,T,\\iota$ 满足 [[18-df-arithmetic-realization]]：$S$ 为一阶签名，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，$\\iota$ 是从源算术公式到目标公式的固定单值图，并包含下式全部 $\\mathrm{Total}_e$。$\\mathfrak T=\\langle S,T,\\iota\\rangle$。$\\mathsf T^1,U,a_T,\\Phi_e$ 全部采用 [[18-df-computation-coding]] 的本地计算编码，不能另取未提供的外部接口。$f:\\omega\\to\\omega$ 是真实总函数；$e\\in\\omega$，$\\overline e$ 是 [[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]] 的数码；$x_0,x_1$ 是该语言固定枚举中的前两个数变量；终止公式的绑定位置仅使用这两个变量。$\\mathrm{Total}_e$ 是 Tait 公式，$a_T$ 作为三元本原递归函数符号使用。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-computation-coding","status":"resolved","id":"6c1845536b726c45","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,T,\\iota$ 满足 [[18-df-arithmetic-realization]]：$S$ 为一阶签名，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，$\\iota$ 是从源算术公式到目标公式的固定单值图，并包含下式全部 $\\mathrm{Total}_e$。$\\mathfrak T=\\langle S,T,\\iota\\rangle$。$\\mathsf T^1,U,a_T,\\Phi_e$ 全部采用 [[18-df-computation-coding]] 的本地计算编码，不能另取未提供的外部接口。$f:\\omega\\to\\omega$ 是真实总函数；$e\\in\\omega$，$\\overline e$ 是 [[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]] 的数码；$x_0,x_1$ 是该语言固定枚举中的前两个数变量；终止公式的绑定位置仅使用这两个变量。$\\mathrm{Total}_e$ 是 Tait 公式，$a_T$ 作为三元本原递归函数符号使用。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language","status":"resolved","id":"7ddb1b71680edcd2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,T,\\iota$ 满足 [[18-df-arithmetic-realization]]：$S$ 为一阶签名，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，$\\iota$ 是从源算术公式到目标公式的固定单值图，并包含下式全部 $\\mathrm{Total}_e$。$\\mathfrak T=\\langle S,T,\\iota\\rangle$。$\\mathsf T^1,U,a_T,\\Phi_e$ 全部采用 [[18-df-computation-coding]] 的本地计算编码，不能另取未提供的外部接口。$f:\\omega\\to\\omega$ 是真实总函数；$e\\in\\omega$，$\\overline e$ 是 [[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]] 的数码；$x_0,x_1$ 是该语言固定枚举中的前两个数变量；终止公式的绑定位置仅使用这两个变量。$\\mathrm{Total}_e$ 是 Tait 公式，$a_T$ 作为三元本原递归函数符号使用。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,T,\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Total}_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak T=\\langle S,T,\\iota\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf T^1,U,a_T,\\Phi_e","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"e\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline e","display":false},{"tex":"x_0,x_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Total}_e","display":false},{"tex":"a_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Total}_e\\coloneqq\\forall x_0\\;\\exists x_1\\;(a_T(\\overline e,x_0,x_1)=\\overline1)\\qquad(e\\in\\omega).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall e\\in\\omega\\quad\\mathrm{Total}_e\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProvablyRecursive}_{\\mathfrak T}(f)\\longleftrightarrow\n\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;[&\\operatorname{ArPrv}_{S,T,\\iota}(\\mathrm{Total}_e)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in\\omega\\;\\exists s\\in\\omega\\;\\mathsf T^1(e,x,s)\\\\\n&\\land f=\\Phi_e].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3299,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-124","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-provably-recursive-function]]"},{"id":"dc9d6eee9578d7f8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak T=\\langle S,T,\\iota\\rangle$ 满足 [[18-df-provably-recursive-function]] 的全部条件，计算编码由该节点的本地依赖固定。$\\mathrm{ProvablyRecursive}_{\\mathfrak T}(f)$ 取其精确定义，所有 $f$ 均为一元总函数 $\\omega\\to\\omega$。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-64","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-provably-recursive-function]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-84","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-provably-recursive-function]]"}]